      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and honestly it just feels like a pulled muscle. i've had back stuff before and it always just gets better with rest and advil. if i take like 800mg every few hours for the next day or so should that be enough to get the inflammation down? i'm pretty sure i just overdid it with the heavy lifting so it's probably fine to just stay home and manage it.",
